%% Reservation life cycle (server-side authoritative states)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> HELD : POST /reservations (operationId)
    HELD --> CONFIRMED : simulated payment SUCCEEDED before holdExpiresAt
    HELD --> HELD : payment DECLINED (retry allowed until expiry)
    HELD --> EXPIRED : holdExpiresAt passed (expiry job / lazy check)
    HELD --> CANCELLED : driver cancels
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : driver cancels before startTime
    CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED : endTime passed
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]
